<title>USA: Sullivan Dental buys Professional Practice.</title>
<headline>Sullivan Dental buys Professional Practice.</headline>
<dateline>WEST ALLIS, Wis. 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sullivan Dental Products Inc said Thursday it reached an agreement in principle to buy Professional Practice Transitions LLC, a broker in deals involving acquisitions of dental practices.</p>
<p>Terms of the purchase were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Professional Practice is based in Green Bay, Wis., Sullivan Dental said.</p>
